    editorNote: 'Do not treat one source as covering all six styles, even now that all six have one — each is specific to that style\'s own demands and injury profile. Boxing and Muay Thai in particular carry real head/limb-impact risk that no conditioning citation addresses; see each style\'s own editorNote.',
